{"title":"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 34","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solutions\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solutions</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_34&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>When the circumference of a toy balloon is increased from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/3/f8366cd6196dd8a9da6d38a3e9eafb109e99d53e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> inches to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/6/66644fd9f411299c3c1eabf151b5f601c9ef6c21.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$25$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> inches, the radius is increased by:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/e/1/3e106e6098a57d026914140ff0a9f6bf25047157.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 5\\text{ in} \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ 2\\dfrac{1}{2}\\text{ in} \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ \\dfrac{5}{\\pi}\\text{ in} \\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ \\dfrac{5}{2\\pi}\\text{ in} \\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ \\dfrac{\\pi}{5}\\text{ in}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"485\" height=\"37\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solutions\">Solutions</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_34&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solutions\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_34&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>When the circumference of a circle is increased by a percentage, the radius is also increased by the same percentage (or else the ratio of the circumference to the diameter wouldn't be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/c/f2ca003a7da0de4994b4733e203b74ff52d42553.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\pi$\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" /> anymore)\nWe see that the circumference was increased by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/6/96633b73a86b9d9110e1ff824fce08def96ca296.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$25\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" />. This means the radius was also increased by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/6/96633b73a86b9d9110e1ff824fce08def96ca296.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$25\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" />. The radius of the original balloon is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/5/c853aaeffc972e67474a8c78b53f1775701ae310.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{20}{2\\pi}=\\frac{10}{\\pi}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"69\" height=\"37\" />. With the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/6/96633b73a86b9d9110e1ff824fce08def96ca296.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$25\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" /> increase, it becomes <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/0/aa0ddff9831a1f734ef96c565fa678990ef92318.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{12.5}{\\pi}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"38\" height=\"38\" />. The increase is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/1/ef120558487150260ce98182655213deb03db985.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{12.5-10}{\\pi}=\\frac{2.5}{\\pi}=\\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}\\ \\dfrac{5}{2\\pi}\\text{ in}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"242\" height=\"48\" />.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_34&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>Circumference of a circle is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/f/8/5f89c6c588d8ccee67ef84b70fc8d4f1c3c886ad.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2 \\pi r$\" width=\"28\" height=\"12\" /> so the radius is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/f/a1ff49e412a073106abf004a3fa08d101f104703.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{circumference}{2 \\pi}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"127\" height=\"39\" />\n</p><p>So radius of first circle\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/3/6/93604d535d126a9d70aea45c3c394325e0e13199.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[2 \\pi r = 20\\]\" width=\"70\" height=\"12\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/d/55d14d828280d7e230432a584edae0647bbe0159.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[r = \\frac{10}{\\pi}\\]\" width=\"53\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p>Radius of second circle\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/d/84dff0782507a4e9df54419e1d6739b778554436.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[2 \\pi r = 25\\]\" width=\"70\" height=\"13\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/2/4/d248c567b97f5734c46113c7bf0206b05df5814f.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[r = \\frac{25}{2 \\pi}\\]\" width=\"55\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>The difference of these radii is \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/c/82c23bb12777e066ae119823943c3b17f72f704d.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{25}{2 \\pi} - \\frac{10}{\\pi} = \\frac{5}{2 \\pi}\\]\" width=\"113\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>So the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/3/6c325db6abe23a7ef69caff4d1b740512dfd49b0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}\\ \\dfrac{5}{2\\pi}\\text{ in}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"90\" height=\"48\" />.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_34&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>Let the radius of the circle with the larger circumference be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/4/0b4f3f4b698ce35667432041e168f7653533fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r_2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"17\" height=\"13\" /> and the circle with the smaller circumference be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/c/adc143c3f887fa7e92fd80d91bb22af51b4abd77.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r_1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"17\" height=\"13\" />. Calculating the ratio of the two\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/0/1/001a7f1616a08519e40d60e0d1c42099d89c6b3b.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{r_2}{r_1}=\\frac{25}{20}=\\frac{5}{4}\\]\" width=\"99\" height=\"40\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/7/0/670fbcfc729ddea65ad81b444f10a7b682f4c699.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[4r_2=5r_1\\]\" width=\"71\" height=\"15\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/2/9e2aceda65f8e47d5bfc3e65b1cd474e1103e62d.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[4(r_2-r_1)=r_1\\]\" width=\"114\" height=\"18\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/4/304ac123a34cd7fb4197f1a21205cd954c974737.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[r_2-r_1=\\frac{r_1}{4}=\\frac{\\frac{20}{2\\pi}}{4}=\\frac{10}{4\\pi}=\\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}\\ \\dfrac{5}{2\\pi}\\text{ in}}\\]\" width=\"306\" height=\"48\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_34&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME\" title=\"1950 AHSME\">1950 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1950 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1950\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_33\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 33\">Problem 33</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_35\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 35\">Problem 35</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13\" tit